                                "sense_id": "5a0587f6-1d0b-3def-9eb9-3f90948020f1",
                                "text": "With added sorrow she had her interred there by torch-light—herself sole mourner. It was a relief to be unwitnessed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa50d7b6-b7e6-4c18-b582-a1cb3f5afb33",
                                "sense_id": "5a0587f6-1d0b-3def-9eb9-3f90948020f1",
                                "text": "Her fate has absorbed Britons, touching the nation’s sense of pity and outrage in a way unwitnessed since the murders of two 10-year-old girls, Holly Wells and Jessica Chapman, in the village of Soham in 2002."
                            }
                        ]
